{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>But his flesh aches upon him</b> — its meaning is: it melts and rots and is destroyed, like וכל החלקה הטובה תכאיבו באבנים (and all the good portion you shall pain with stones). And he explained עליו as upon himself. And the way of derash is well known. And בשרו is his body; and there are many like it in Ecclesiastes."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:38.005772941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}